&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional programming experience including experience at a software product company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in one or more of the following languages Typescript, Golang, Python or other server side languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked in a microservice-based architecture and are proficient in Docker and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
